    "description": "First paragraph of the About dialog."
  },
  "aboutPhases": "Phase 1: Color vision deficiency simulation\nPhase 2: Hearing impairment simulation (coming soon)\nPhase 3: Other ways of seeing beyond color — visual field loss, blur, and more (selectable under Advanced, with a live preview)",
